==== hyperbricks yaml {!{hypermedia}} ====
hypermedia:
  - type: hypermedia
  - text_10:
      - type: text
      - value: HELLO WORLD!
  - bodytag: <body id="main">|</body>
  - enclose: <p>|</p>
  - nocache: "true"
  - route: index
==== explainer ====
Explicitly disable cache
